# Cursor AI Mandatory Rules

## 🚨 MANDATORY USER RESPONSE PROTOCOL:
Before answering any user request:
1. ALWAYS read `docs/LAST_UPDATES.md`.
2. In your response to the user, you MUST explicitly include this section:
   "Кстати, вот последние изменения, которые вносил другой разработчик:
   1. [Recent change 1]
   2. [Recent change 2]
   3. [Recent change 3]"

## Post-Flight:
When you finish making changes, you MUST add a new entry to the very top of `docs/LAST_UPDATES.md` with:
- Timestamp & Author
- Summary of what was done
- List of modified/created files
